cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these calculators or cite their output, please cite this software."
title: "ai-economics-mcp: calculators for AI cost, energy and verification, as MCP tools"
abstract: >-
  Twelve deterministic calculators exposed as Model Context Protocol tools, so an
  agent can price its own work instead of estimating it: token cost across GPT,
  Claude, Gemini and DeepSeek with prompt-cache discount; context-window sizing;
  fully-loaded agent-hour cost including human review; model-routing savings; LLM
  energy, cost and CO2; joules per verified task; Proof-Adjusted Autonomy;
  revocation exposure; and proof debt. Every response carries the formula it used.
  No API key, no account, and inputs are never stored.
type: software
